#: includes/Admin/Screen/UnmatchedPage.php:97
msgid "iSport publishes no link between a course and the classes that make it up, so the plugin works it out from the name and the time. Anything it could not place with confidence is here, together with the classes it decided belong to nobody — hall rentals, open sessions, and activities that take no bookings. Choosing a course records the answer for good: no later synchronisation will decide otherwise."
